*.sln
*.sw?

# Playwright Tier 2 runtime E2E artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
__tests__/e2e-runtime/test-results/
__tests__/e2e-runtime/playwright-report/

# vitest 覆盖率产物（npm run test:coverage 生成）
coverage/

